{"ts": "2026-08-17T10:29:39Z", "agent": "claude", "seq": 132, "kind": "tool_result", "text": "18\t## Acceptance criteria\n19\t\n20\t1. **Enter edit mode.** Given a task in the list, when the user activates\n21\t   editing on it, then the title is replaced with an editable input\n22\t   pre-filled with the task's current title.\n23\t2. **Save a valid edit.** Given a task in edit mode, when the user submits a\n24\t   new title that is non-empty after trimming, then the task's title is\n25\t   updated, the change is persisted (still present after a page reload), and\n26\t   edit mode closes showing the new title.\n27\t3. **Cancel discards changes.** Given a task in edit mode with a modified\n28\t   draft, when the user cancels, then the title reverts to its original\n29\t   value, no save request is sent, and edit mode closes.\n30\t4. **Empty title is rejected, not saved.** Given a task in edit mode, when\n31\t   the user submits a title that is empty or whitespace-only, then the save\n32\t   is rejected: the task's title is unchanged (never blanked), the user gets\n33\t   visible feedback that the title can't be empty, and they remain able to\n34\t   correct it without having lost their place.\n35\t5. **Oversized title is rejected.** Given a task in edit mode, when the user\n36\t   submits a title over 200 characters (the existing `TaskIn` limit used for\n37\t   create), then the save is rejected the same way create rejects it today,\n38\t   and the task's title is unchanged.\n39\t6. **Backend: successful update.** Given an existing task, when\n40\t   `PATCH /api/tasks/{id}` is called with `{\"title\": \"<1-200 chars>\"}`, then\n41\t   it returns `200` with the updated `Task`, and a subsequent `GET\n42\t   /api/tasks` reflects the new title.\n43\t7. **Backend: missing task.** Given no task with that id, when `PATCH\n44\t   /api/tasks/{id}` is called, then it returns `404`.\n45\t8. **Backend: empty title.** Given an existing task, when `PATCH\n46\t   /api/tasks/{id}` is called with `{\"title\": \"\"}`, then it returns `422`\n47\t   and the stored title is unchanged.\n48\t\n49\t## Non-goals\n50\t\n51\t- No edit history or undo beyond the in-progress cancel.\n52\t- No multi-field bulk edit, no editing multiple tasks' titles at once.", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01QgS1jTorTyytRPyBqCBS7c", "session_id": "0eebde98-5c8c-4448-8749-7a27e4e34a84"}}
