this cycle is e2e, not\n   component-level. Pre-existing gap per the story stage's own note.\n3. `backend/tests/_scratch_check_422.py` is still untracked scratch content\n   in the working tree. Delete it (or fold its assertion into\n   `backend/tests/test_tasks.py`) before this branch is committed \u2014 it isn't\n   part of the intended deliverable.\n\n## Spec/design conformance\n\nAll 8 acceptance criteria verified passing against the current code, live:\nAC1-5 via the e2e suite (including the two open-question defaults), AC6-8 via\nthe backend suite. No must-fix items remain.\n\nVERDICT: approve-with-followups"}, "session_id": "0eebde98-5c8c-4448-8749-7a27e4e34a84"}}
